      "description": "To learn about the adoption of agricultural technologies, we systematically take stock of past adoption literature. Using a systematic search string, we identified relevant studies of innovation adoption and extracted quantitative estimates from eligible studies. For a detailed description of the process refer to:\n-\tSchulz, D., & Börner, J. (2022). Innovation context and technology traits explain heterogeneity across studies of agricultural technology adoption: A meta‐analysis. Journal of Agricultural Economics, 1477-9552.12521. https://doi.org/10.1111/1477-9552.12521",
